{
  "label": "Levelling",
  "type": "game",
  "name": "levels/1",
  "note": "How a village grows, level by level (play/SPEC.md §4.9).",
  "node": {
    "description": "The levelling config is { schema: 'levels/1', label, note, villager: { euros, hearts } (what each new villager brings), minds: { heartsPerMind, step, heartsPerEuro } (a mind costs heartsPerMind + step × (level − 1) hearts, or that over heartsPerEuro in euros), levels: [{ id, villagers (the count that reaches it: Fibonacci 1, 2, 3, 5, 8 …), phase, investor (the investor's ticket as a multiple of the euros the level's new villagers bring), unlocks: [{ label, cost (euros), kind? }], note? }] }. The Game editor works out the rest: each level's new villagers, their euros and hearts and the minds they get, the investor's euros and minds and share, the minds minted, and the treasury in euros (raised and left after building), hearts and minds.",
    "type": "object",
    "required": [
      "schema",
      "label",
      "villager",
      "minds",
      "levels"
    ],
    "properties": {
      "schema": {
        "const": "levels/1"
      },
      "label": {
        "type": "string",
        "minLength": 1,
        "maxLength": 200
      },
      "note": {
        "type": "string",
        "maxLength": 20000,
        "x-loro": "text"
      },
      "villager": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "euros",
          "hearts"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "euros": {
            "type": "number",
            "minimum": 0,
            "maximum": 1000000000
          },
          "hearts": {
            "type": "number",
            "minimum": 0,
            "maximum": 1000000000000
          }
        },
        "additionalProperties": true
      },
      "minds": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "heartsPerMind",
          "step",
          "heartsPerEuro"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "heartsPerMind": {
            "type": "number",
            "minimum": 0.0001,
            "maximum": 1000000000
          },
          "step": {
            "type": "number",
            "minimum": 0,
            "maximum": 1000000000
          },
          "heartsPerEuro": {
            "type": "number",
            "minimum": 0.0001,
            "maximum": 1000000000
          }
        },
        "additionalProperties": true
      },
      "levels": {
        "type": "array",
        "minItems": 1,
        "maxItems": 100,
        "items": {
          "type": "object",
          "required": [
            "id",
            "villagers",
            "phase",
            "investor",
            "unlocks"
          ],
          "properties": {
            "id": {
              "type": "string",
              "pattern": "^[A-Za-z0-9][A-Za-z0-9_.-]{0,79}$"
            },
            "villagers": {
              "type": "integer",
              "minimum": 1,
              "maximum": 1000000000
            },
            "phase": {
              "type": "string",
              "minLength": 1,
              "maxLength": 100
            },
            "investor": {
              "type": "number",
              "minimum": 0,
              "maximum": 1000
            },
            "unlocks": {
              "type": "array",
              "maxItems": 50,
              "items": {
                "type": "object",
                "required": [
                  "label",
                  "cost"
                ],
                "properties": {
                  "label": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "minLength": 1,
                    "maxLength": 300
                  },
                  "cost": {
                    "type": "number",
                    "minimum": 0,
                    "maximum": 1000000000000
                  },
                  "kind": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "maxLength": 40
                  },
                  "note": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "maxLength": 2000
                  }
                },
                "additionalProperties": true
              }
            },
            "note": {
              "type": "string",
              "maxLength": 4000
            }
          },
          "additionalProperties": true
        }
      }
    },
    "additionalProperties": true
  }
}
